cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "one-life-g1: a robot brain raised in one continuous life"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hamond
    given-names: Luke
repository-code: "https://github.com/LukeHamond1001/one-life-g1"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
abstract: "A continual-learning architecture for a simulated Unitree G1 humanoid: a predictive model trained online from its own errors, a policy trained by one reward read from a teacher's face, intrinsic rewards for novelty and competence, and nightly replay. No dataset, no task reward, one life never reset. 148 days lived on one Mac at the time of this release."
